{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：16:30 2026-08-29 HKT</p>\n\n<p>《2026香港小姐競選決賽》明晚（30日）於TVB電視城舉行，晚上8時於81台翡翠台進行直播。12位候選佳麗包括：1號袁絲珩、2號李澤欣、3號李澄晴、4號譚雅文、5號魏欣、6號盧蔚晴、7號楊媛媛、8號鄧匡閔、9號周芳姿、10號陳梓穎、11號顏懿菲以及12號湯家琳，她們將競逐本年度香港小姐冠軍、亞軍、季軍、最上鏡小姐、友誼小姐及總值逾港幣651萬獎金及獎品。香港小姐2026的大會司儀為陸浩明、鄭衍峰、馬國明、蕭正楠及曹永廉。今日（29日）陸浩明現身綵排，亦回應到日前向女友陳詩欣求婚成功一事。</p>\n<h2>陸浩明向拍拖14年女友陳詩欣求婚</h2>\n<p>陸浩明日前他在社交平台宣布，向拍拖14年的女友陳詩欣求婚成功。即將結婚的陸浩明受訪時指，為了今次馬爾代夫求婚之旅準備一年，因女友喜歡浪漫、也未去過馬爾代夫，出發前也擔心女友會否發現他準備的求婚驚喜，幸好事後問她，陳詩欣表示完全沒發現。此外，陸浩明亦否認雙喜臨門，暫時未「造人成功」。</p>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明亦表示，契媽肥媽杯「新抱茶」一定少不了，更自爆被肥媽嘲笑：「你揀金價最貴時結婚！」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ef97882f433fece1c36973eea3c75c1/2026-08/Screenshot_20240326_202655_com_instagram_android.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明宣布向女友陳詩欣求婚成功。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ded685b08173d0bd3674d7c4d1b1c178/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455676189246316_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明和陳詩欣好開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb6fe84570a2e57c17f01aa4ee20ee0d/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455710330847683_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明和陳詩欣身處馬爾代夫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e425acbed7efcd29b2215595b297c659/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455725313024787_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣難掩喜悅之情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff116cf327a3847ea16ab25f6ce2b28b/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455744472590899_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明和陳詩欣於沙灘浪漫晚餐。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f491dfad13d444a8e9e93155d63155e4/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455749757394679_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明和陳詩欣騷巨型鑽戒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9dffa535175bcbe4c059b6b23a658e79/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455770972247298_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明和陳詩欣得到全城祝福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5fdb9ed058b0421204ff6798843834c1/2026-08/lukhoo_2026_8_28_3973455812403545698_708533.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與圈外女友陳詩欣拍拖14年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/84b978ffe14fc75d3bf62a7be22f79a6/2022-11/unknown_278960136_332390412322633_7641291988595567788_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明（6號）與網紅女友陳詩欣（Ayan）好恩愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf54b4584bd54dba461f9c544dccf5ab/2024-09/ayanbubi_1671856853_3000075184123450193_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"二人多年來多次公開放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2264783607aa730467f59c11a9a51f21/2024-09/ayanbubi_1650978490_2824934788105205565_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明2024年與陳詩欣飛台灣墾丁過二人世界。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45024b35eb4215324cdd049f85b2f658/2024-09/Photo_by_on_September_21_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_sarong_pool_and_outdoors_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣身材一流。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5a8db0f1a30c0237e32351b88de93c37/2024-09/VS--VillaHeagrandmaskentingInstagram-0_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣亦換上多套款式的水著，陸續在IG上分享性感靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/31710b2bbb693bf27812c1b1170b7297/2024-09/Photo_by_on_September_21_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_and_bra_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣在IG上大派粉絲福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/326e804c205340cbc70edad53b65a382/2024-09/Photo_by_on_September_15_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_and_bra_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣極吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5797d4b1ec2855bb0735a37cbf90ca2e/2024-09/Photo_by_on_September_15_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_bra_and_pool_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣令人着迷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/94c39c2428e5347b02089bfb19d2020f/2024-09/Photo_by_on_September_15_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_bra_and_pool_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與女友陳詩欣沙灘漫步，充滿粉紅色泡泡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b6dbe4d03a700155f3c0274c6d37f96d/2024-09/VS--sunsetInstagram-0_02_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與女友陳詩欣沙灘漫步，充滿粉紅色泡泡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3c9cc142947ab881f6a13c2c8301c65f/2024-09/Photo_shared_by_on_September_14_2024_tagging_lukhoo_and_ay6style_May_be_an_image_of_2_people_sundress_beach_twilight_and_ocean_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男友視角甜蜜蜜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83611694dc86453dbc2ff27c294e8c5b/2024-09/Photo_by_on_September_14_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_sundress_dress_beach_cloud_and_twilight_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣墾丁谷胸大解放露豐滿上圍！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c876846e001cff6d598318a73a6d887/2024-09/Photo_shared_by_6_on_September_15_2024_tagging_ayanbubi_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_sarong_pool_and_outdoors_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"不過有不少網民放錯重點，留意到陸浩明的褲浪位稍微隆起。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f960d75ce7730b89a408f215ec7529c5/2024-09/Photo_by_6_on_September_15_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_sarong_and_pool_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"不過有不少網民放錯重點，留意到陸浩明的褲浪位稍微隆起。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6bfff4b28c6f2e5e2d66e878477633b9/2024-09/Photo_by_6_on_September_15_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_sarong_and_pool_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣拍靚相留倩影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7293788206a419ac257df3ac0516875b/2023-12/ayanbubi_1621061578_2573973534189385965_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣拍靚相留倩影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/70cbd611eb29e28cda837b153e19162f/2023-12/ayanbubi_1635434637_2694543496298990356_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣拍靚相留倩影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7edb32cf6ee931e3ac001c8c8ebaca19/2023-12/ayanbubi_1672317417_3003938675674636942_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<h2>陸浩明與陳詩欣預計明年舉行婚禮</h2>\n<p>陸浩明透露求婚鑽戒約2卡，對結婚一直有「時間表」，笑言結婚不會要未婚妻陳詩欣再等十年，預計明年舉行婚禮，正與另一半討論在香港或海外舉行婚宴。陸浩明亦表示，契媽肥媽杯「新抱茶」一定少不了，更自爆被肥媽嘲笑：「你揀金價最貴時結婚！」雖然肥媽曾笑言送「足金農場」賀他結婚，但若她送上一首歌也足夠開心。</p>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明與陳詩欣拍拖多年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/18f1dd870bd0077056092ae6c41b65a9/2023-12/ayanbubi_1650978490_2824934788096691569_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣不時派福利照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a47550df952759a32ac3b11583966f1b/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156763980965_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣同時亦是一名KOL。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/372f30b611fd50d8be8e12456a0473cc/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156772393542_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣常晒身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/80aa4ccd22941036635ca7783c40f3de/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156772562092_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣外形不輸明星。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd81da9672d0ba4e04507b5fec99af88/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156831166103_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣常晒身材吸Like。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/326c40bb6387911eb3daaaed83031641/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682601302_3090206156847934510_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣常晒身材吸Like。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a3c26f4bce25493b41d7da0d17190aa9/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682945619_3093094498144885192_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣常晒身材吸Like。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc611acafa570b2b284547b4dd108095/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682945619_3093094498144969906_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣愛晒泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/789e3af8fc9a86dd447c6c9f9d5e22be/2023-12/ayanbubi_1682945619_3093094498153480753_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣愛晒泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5186303310ed11a04281a83ee62f71a5/2023-12/ayanbubi_1685441989_3114035569821686382_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣愛晒泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b10447629598a03b8ffc15e064dcb5a/2023-12/ayanbubi_1685441989_3114035569821711533_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣愛晒泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/74b4e24c886865b9d181a0fb8beb0f3c/2023-12/ayanbubi_1685441989_3114035569830002522_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陸浩明女友陳詩欣愛晒泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f07c8a2a087fa14b0a615e914e51988/2023-12/ayanbubi_1685441989_3114035569939014748_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"外遊必穿三點式。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ee3175bfb71fd14ed697ab876eb25f7a/2023-12/ayanbubi_1696426859_3206183339717743499_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"外遊必穿三點式。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0324f23e037ecfbef67951f58541cf6c/2023-12/ayanbubi_1696426859_3206183339726095951_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"外遊必穿三點式。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f41ad6f9313290c5638ac997e9880e26/2023-12/ayanbubi_1696426859_3206183339726143549_1047905.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣經常PO靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f08b56b9edadae2962a577bd6650c655/2024-09/Photo_by_on_August_31_2024_May_be_an_image_of_2_people_and_Victoria_Peak__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣同陸浩明好sweet。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4427a608504feff608107624a1b943fa/2024-09/Photo_shared_by_6_on_September_12_2024_tagging_ayanbubi_and_ay6style_May_be_an_image_of_2_people_people_kissing_and_text__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣上圍好澎湃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/238f77e416566628f3b9a8e65aca4931/2024-09/_______d_skinsolutionscenter____C_HA_Bling_Pump_Ball____Cup____________0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣好多水著相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7685baf995d126675b968da2be7d4f75/2024-09/Photo_by_on_September_13_2024_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_hair_bra_pool_and_outdoors__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣陸浩明周圍飛去旅行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aef61387a778f8d1f129357f8d679cef/2024-09/________0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"二人感情好好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d754ad48d2fe5e9e224ec962eda31349/2024-09/Happy_Anniversary___________cityofdreamsmacau___royalcaviarclub_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詩欣經常周圍影靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/047f80653fc9ea42a6733435ed127f5e/2024-09/Photo_by_in_O_a_Santorini_Greece__0.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T08:38:32.343286+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":596,"images":49,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}